      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOLLOW THAT TUNE (3) was well supported last time but could only manage second (25.90), beaten 1.75 lengths. Comes through a solid form race last start. Deserves a win and gets his chance. SLICK TILLY (1) has been in super consistent form, last time breaking from this same box when third in a Rank Limit - Grade 7 at this track (20.61) and making it three straight placings. Should be in this for a long way. DR. AURORA (2) failed to come into contention last start after losing her position early at Sale, but prior to that won by 1.5 lengths at Warragul (23.37) beating Dr. Emilia in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win on August 6. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. AMARYLLIS (8) is worth a look over a shorter distance this time.",
